[
  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. Convert to Sheet Metal of cylindrical and conical faces and their Flat Patterns (mitcad#2435). Rules F1: t 2, K 0.5 (the neutral surface in the middle of the material)."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sheet_rules", "thickness": 2, "bend_radius": 3, "allowance": {"type": "k_factor", "k": 0.5}, "reference_side": "front", "bend_relief": {"type": "rectangular", "width": 2, "depth": 3}, "corner_relief": {"type": "round", "width": 2, "depth": 3}}},

  {"comment": "A tube: Sketch F2's rectangle (18, 0)-(20, 50) revolved once about Y (F3). Its outer face (c2, at radius 20) converts: the material behind it, the neutral radius 19, opened at the face's seam by the corner gap (the thickness, 2): the blank is 38 pi - 2 by 50, 1900 pi - 100; folded, the tube less the gap's 2/19 rad, 3800 pi - 200."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F2", "corner": [18, 0], "width": 2, "height": 50},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "revolve",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F2", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "axis": "y", "extent": {"type": "full"}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sheet_convert", "rules": "F1", "body": "F3.b0", "face": "F3:side(c2[c1,c3])"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F4", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 1, "body": "F3.b0", "volume": 11738.052083641214}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "sheet_state", "body": "F3.b0"}, "result": {"status": "valid"}}},
  {"cmd": "set_flat_pattern", "body": "F3.b0"},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "flat_pattern", "body": "F3.b0"}, "result": {"status": "valid", "area": 5869.026041820606}}},
  {"cmd": "export_flat_pattern_dxf", "body": "F3.b0", "path": "sheet_convert_curved_tube.dxf"},
  {"comment": "With K 0.3 the neutral radius is 18.6: the blank (37.2 pi - 2) 50, the gap 2/18.6 rad of the tube."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F1", "def": {"type": "sheet_rules", "thickness": 2, "bend_radius": 3, "allowance": {"type": "k_factor", "k": 0.3}, "reference_side": "front", "bend_relief": {"type": "rectangular", "width": 2, "depth": 3}, "corner_relief": {"type": "round", "width": 2, "depth": 3}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F4", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F3.b0", "volume": 11733.751008372397}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "flat_pattern", "body": "F3.b0"}, "result": {"status": "valid", "area": 5743.362335677016}}},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F1", "def": {"type": "sheet_rules", "thickness": 2, "bend_radius": 3, "allowance": {"type": "k_factor", "k": 0.5}, "reference_side": "front", "bend_relief": {"type": "rectangular", "width": 2, "depth": 3}, "corner_relief": {"type": "round", "width": 2, "depth": 3}}},
  {"comment": "A closed face cannot open with no gap at its seam."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F4", "def": {"type": "sheet_convert", "rules": "F1", "body": "F3.b0", "face": "F3:side(c2[c1,c3])", "corner_gap": 0}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F4", "status": "error", "error_contains": "the corner gap there must be above 0"}},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F4", "def": {"type": "sheet_convert", "rules": "F1", "body": "F3.b0", "face": "F3:side(c2[c1,c3])"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F4", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F3.b0", "volume": 11738.052083641214}},

  {"comment": "A conical frustum: Sketch F5's rectangle 50 x 2 along the generator of half angle asin 0.6 from (30, 0) (A (30, 0), B (60, 40), C (58.4, 41.2), D (28.4, 1.2)), revolved half a turn about Y (F6). Its outer face (c1, 50 to 100 from its apex) converts: the neutral cone 1 inside it lies 50 - 4/3 to 100 - 4/3 from its apex; developed, half a turn is 0.6 pi: the blank's area 0.3 pi (98.667^2 - 48.667^2) = 2210 pi, and the sheet holds the body, 4420 pi (Pappus)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F5", "start": [30, 0], "end": [60, 40]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F5", "start": "p3", "end": [58.4, 41.2]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F5", "start": "p5", "end": [28.4, 1.2]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F5", "start": "p7", "end": "p2"},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "revolve",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5", "region": "r{c1[c8,c4],c4[c1,c6],c6[c4,c8],c8[c6,c1]}"}],
    "axis": "y", "extent": {"type": "angle", "angle": 3.141592653589793}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sheet_convert", "rules": "F1", "body": "F6.b0", "face": "F6:side(c1[c8,c4])"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F7", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F6.b0", "volume": 13885.839528866885}},
  {"cmd": "set_flat_pattern", "body": "F6.b0"},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "flat_pattern", "body": "F6.b0"}, "result": {"status": "valid", "area": 6942.919764433443}}},
  {"cmd": "export_flat_pattern_dxf", "body": "F6.b0", "path": "sheet_convert_curved_cone.dxf"},
  {"comment": "Revolved once round, the face is closed: developed 1.2 pi, less a strip 1 wide each side of the seam along the generator (the area between the arcs below 1 from the seam's line); with K 0.5 the folded sheet holds twice its developed area."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F6", "def": {"type": "revolve",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5", "region": "r{c1[c8,c4],c4[c1,c6],c6[c4,c8],c8[c6,c1]}"}],
    "axis": "y", "extent": {"type": "full"}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F7", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F6.b0", "volume": 27571.6721150968}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "flat_pattern", "body": "F6.b0"}, "result": {"status": "valid", "area": 13785.8360575484}}},

  {"comment": "A hole: Sketch F8's rectangle revolved half a turn (F9, the tube at z <= 0), a 10 mm circle at (0, 25) on XY (F10) cut through it along Z (F11). The hole's wall is not normal to the material, so the sheet is the plate the face makes with a warning; its blank is 19 pi 50 less the hole's outline on the face developed at the neutral radius: 19 times the integral of 2 sqrt(25 - 400 sin^2 a) over |a| <= asin 1/4, 75.2099."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F8", "corner": [18, 0], "width": 2, "height": 50},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "revolve",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F8", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "axis": "y", "extent": {"type": "angle", "angle": 3.141592653589793}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F10", "center": [0, 25], "diameter": 10},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F10", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "through_all", "both_sides": true}, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F9.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sheet_convert", "rules": "F1", "body": "F9.b0", "face": "F9:side(c2[c1,c3])"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F12", "status": "warning", "error_contains": "not normal to the material"}},
  {"cmd": "set_flat_pattern", "body": "F9.b0"},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "flat_pattern", "body": "F9.b0"}, "result": {"status": "valid", "area": 2909.3031579091376}, "tolerance": 1e-5}},

  {"comment": "Faces that cannot be laid flat: a sphere's (F13) bends two ways; a solid cylinder's side (F15) has no back. (The reported transition, a loft from a rectangle to a circle, is sheet_convert_curved_reported.)"},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sphere", "plane": "xy", "center": [200, 0], "diameter": 20, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sheet_convert", "rules": "F1", "body": "F13.b0", "face": "F13:side0"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F14", "status": "error", "error_contains": "the face cannot be laid flat: it is a spherical surface curved in two directions"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder", "plane": "xy", "center": [300, 0], "diameter": 40, "height": 50, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sheet_convert", "rules": "F1", "body": "F15.b0", "face": "F15:side0"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F16", "status": "error", "error_contains": "is not a plate of its rules' thickness"}}
]
